@page "/hello"
@inject HelloService Hello

<PageTitle>Hello module</PageTitle>

<h1>Hello module</h1>

<p>@Hello.Greeting</p>

<p>
    This page lives in <code>Atrium.Modules.Hello</code>. The host found it by reflection, called
    <code>RegisterServices</code> (which is why <code>HelloService</code> injected), and added the
    assembly to the router — no host code references this module by name.
</p>
